## Freeze — do not change (breaks upgrades)

Extension UUID `tokens-go-brrr@fredrickmakoffu.github.io`, D-Bus `TokensGoBrrr`, CSS `tokens-go-brrr-*`, config/data dirs, systemd unit, RPM/DEB name.

## Display rename is display-only

Popover kicker, notifications, site copy, README titles may say `tokens-go-brrr` / `Tokens go brrr`. Do not "fix" the freeze list when renaming UI strings.

## Voice by surface

- **README / CLI / daemon:** engineer-precise, short "why" where it matters. No meme gags.
- **Extension chrome:** sober brand + data. No site copy jokes (`−1.2k`, shake/`brrr`).
- **Site (`site/`):** meme-forward OK — hero lowercase, meter gags, one job per section.
- **Privacy claims:** only what the code does (local credentials read-only, no scraping).

When packaging blurbs list providers, keep them in sync with README (Cursor, Claude, OpenCode, Codex, Pi).
